mOptions and its helpers called\ngridHeader.getOptionSetObject().getOptions() directly to resolve option\ncodes for grid metadata. That collection is L2-cached by ID list only;\nreassembling entities under a cold entity-level cache falls back to one\nSELECT per option (profiled: 6,713 individual optionvalue selects,\n1.38s of a 2s /analytics/events/query response).\n\nThread an injectable options resolver through QueryItemHelper instead,\nwired at the three real callers to OptionService.findOptionsByNamePattern,\nwhich fetches the option set in one query and bypasses the broken\ncollection-cache path entirely. Matching semantics are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"2d446ef092028ebc0d5f8fc75611777dc1a27d07","tree_id":"1076e5334d1df91de4202f26ba7a038c12663f7b","timestamp":"2026-08-15T06:04:39Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https